        <mxCell id="ach_cond" parent="YVxcspwUH4dH9gIVws8s-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Condition_Type (int)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0050EF;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;(link Lookup_Code)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="330" height="30" as="geometry" y="120" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ach_target_id" parent="YVxcspwUH4dH9gIVws8s-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Target_ID (int, NULL)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="330" height="30" as="geometry" y="150" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ach_target_value" parent="YVxcspwUH4dH9gIVws8s-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Target_Value (int)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="330" height="30" as="geometry" y="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ach_reward_type" parent="YVxcspwUH4dH9gIVws8s-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Reward_Type (int)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0050EF;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;(link Lookup_Code)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="330" height="30" as="geometry" y="210" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ach_reward_item" parent="YVxcspwUH4dH9gIVws8s-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Reward_Item_Basic_ID (int, FK, NULL)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="330" height="30" as="geometry" y="240" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ach_reward_amount" parent="YVxcspwUH4dH9gIVws8s-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Reward_Amount (int)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="330" height="30" as="geometry" y="270" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note_rule_equip_slot" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Equip_Slot&lt;/b&gt; (varchar + CHECK, không dùng Lookup):&lt;br&gt;HEAD | CHEST | GLOVES | BELT | BOOTS&lt;br&gt;AMULET | RING_LEFT | RING_RIGHT&lt;br&gt;MAIN_HAND | OFF_HAND&lt;br&gt;WEAPON_2H chiếm MAIN_HAND và khóa OFF_HAND." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="340" x="1020" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_rule_lookup" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#FF0000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;verticalAlign=top;strokeWidth=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rule – Lookup_Code&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Cột có &lt;span style=&quot;color:#0050EF;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;(link Lookup_Code)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; ở entity lưu &lt;b&gt;Lookup_Int&lt;/b&gt; (1, 2, 3…). Tra: WHERE Lookup_Object = ? AND Lookup_Int = ? — VD Item.Item_Quality = 3 → ('QUALITY', 3) → EPIC. UNIQUE (Lookup_Object, Lookup_Int).&lt;br&gt;2. Lookup dùng chung: STAT (Item_Stat, Class_Stat_Growth, Status_Stat, Skill_Effect), QUALITY (Item, Creep_Stat, Creep_Drop, Quest_Reward, NPC_Spawn), SKILL_TYPE / SKILL_DAMAGE_TYPE (Skill, Creep_Skill, Status), REWARD_TYPE (Quest_Reward, Achievement), EFFECT_TARGET (Skill_Effect, Creep_Skill_Effect)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="1095" x="3375" y="740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_rule_character" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#FF0000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;verticalAlign=top;strokeWidth=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rule – Character&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. CharacterNum = thứ tự slot nhân vật trong Account: UNIQUE (Account_ID, CharacterNum); số slot tối đa = Game_Config MAX_CHARACTER_SLOT.&lt;br&gt;2. Tạo Character (1 transaction): INSERT Character → Character_Stat (tính từ Class).&lt;br&gt;3. Character_Stat là bảng tính sẵn = Class.Basic_* + Class_Stat_Growth × (Level − 1) + stat Item đang mặc (cột cố định + Item_Stat) + Skill_Effect passive; tính lại khi equip / unequip, lên level, tiến hóa Class, học skill.&lt;br&gt;4. Character_Current_HP / MP = HP / MP tối đa đã tính. Máu / mana đang có trong trận chỉ giữ ở game server; login lại hồi sinh đầy nên không lưu.&lt;br&gt;5. Lên level theo Level_Exp: Exp ≥ Exp_Required → Level + 1, SkillPoint + Skill_Point_Reward.&lt;br&gt;6. Character_Skill_Learned UNIQUE (Character_ID, Skill_ID); Character_Skill_Slot PK (Character_ID, SkillNo) → 1 ô chỉ gắn 1 skill.&lt;br&gt;7. CHECK Gold ≥ 0 (theo Character), Diamond ≥ 0 (theo Account)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="380" x="-40" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_rule_region" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#FF0000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;verticalAlign=top;strokeWidth=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rule – Region / Drop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Region = 1 map (Map 1, Map 2…), kèm NPC của khu vực đó (NPC.Region_ID).&lt;br&gt;2. Đồ rơi từ quái: chọn Item_Basic theo Region_Item_Basic của map, random theo Drop_Weight (VD Kiếm 70, Rìu 25, Nhẫn 5 → 70% / 25% / 5%); Vendor refresh cũng chọn như vậy.&lt;br&gt;3. Creep_Drop: đồ riêng của 1 Creep / Boss, rơi thêm theo Drop_Rate %, Quality ≥ Quality_Min (VD Boss luôn rơi 1 món ≥ EPIC); quest item cũng khai báo ở đây.&lt;br&gt;4. Region_Chest: tối đa Max_Spawn rương trên map, mở xong sau Respawn_Time giây xuất hiện lại; rơi Drop_Count_Min – Max món (chọn như mục 2, Chest_Type càng cao Quality càng tốt) + Gold_Min – Max.&lt;br&gt;5. Creep / Boss xuất hiện theo Region_Creep (xem Rule – Creep / Boss). Login lại: BE đưa người chơi về điểm hồi sinh." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="780" x="2530" y="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
